<section class="problem section section--sand" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem__grid">

      <!-- Copy column -->
      <div class="problem__copy">
        <p class="t-eyebrow problem__label" data-anim>The daily chaos</p>

        <h2 class="t-h2 problem__title" data-anim data-anim-delay="1">
          You know&nbsp;the&nbsp;routine.
        </h2>

        <p class="problem__body" data-anim data-anim-delay="2">
          You sit down, open the laptop, and within two minutes there they are — strolling across the keyboard, parking between you and the monitor, "helping" you send <code style="background:rgba(43,39,34,.08);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85em;">TGFFFF8F4$$</code> to the group chat. You move them. They come back. The Zoom call starts.
        </p>

        <ul class="fails-list" data-anim data-anim-delay="2">
          <li><span class="fail-x">❌</span> <s>Floor bed — they ignore it</s></li>
          <li><span class="fail-x">❌</span> <s>Closed door — the guilt is unbearable</s></li>
          <li><span class="fail-x">❌</span> <s>Lap — try typing like that</s></li>
        </ul>

        <p class="problem__turn" data-anim data-anim-delay="3">
          And here's the part nobody says out loud: moving them off the desk doesn't feel like winning. It feels like turning your friend away. They just want to be near you — which is why nothing you've tried has worked.
        </p>

        <p class="problem__transition" data-anim data-anim-delay="4">
          So we stopped trying to keep cats off the desk.<br>
          We built them a better place to be.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Image column -->
      <div class="problem__media" data-anim="scale" data-anim-delay="2">
        <div class="problem__img-wrap">
          {%- if section.settings.image -%}
            {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.image.alt | default: 'Cat sitting in DeskPaws desk bed' }}
          {%- else -%}
            <img
              src="{{ 'cat-curled.png' | asset_url }}"
              alt="Fluffy cat curled up sleeping peacefully in the DeskPaws desk bed"
              width="600"
              height="750"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="problem__float-tag" data-anim data-anim-delay="4">
          <em>Meowcro management</em> — happening 6–10&times; before noon.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "2 — Problem + Guilt",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Cat photo (works great with top-down or cozy shot)"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Problem + Guilt"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
